@host = http://localhost:5070
@classId = c09d9936-1022-4f23-8425-ceb44d2436c9

### Hold a seat -> 201 Created
POST {{host}}/classes/{{classId}}/holds
X-Student-Id: 20101234567890123

### Same student again -> 409 Conflict
POST {{host}}/classes/{{classId}}/holds
X-Student-Id: 20101234567890123

### Missing X-Student-Id -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{host}}/classes/{{classId}}/holds

### Unknown class -> 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/classes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/holds
X-Student-Id: 20101234567890123

### Get hold details -> 200 OK (replace with an id from the create response)
@holdId = 40fd6af1-51b7-4e0d-8c6b-9e863f1777d4
GET {{host}}/holds/{{holdId}}

### Unknown hold -> 404 Not Found
GET {{host}}/holds/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Malformed hold id -> 404 Not Found (route constraint)
GET {{host}}/holds/not-a-guid

### Confirm hold (pay admission fee) -> 200 OK
POST {{host}}/holds/{{holdId}}/confirm
X-Student-Id: 20101234567890123

### Confirm again -> 200 OK (idempotent)
POST {{host}}/holds/{{holdId}}/confirm
X-Student-Id: 20101234567890123

### Confirm as another student -> 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/holds/{{holdId}}/confirm
X-Student-Id: 20109999999999999

### Confirm without X-Student-Id -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{host}}/holds/{{holdId}}/confirm

### Cancel hold -> 204 No Content (use a fresh, unconfirmed hold id)
DELETE {{host}}/holds/{{holdId}}
X-Student-Id: 20101234567890123

### Cancel again -> 204 No Content (idempotent)
DELETE {{host}}/holds/{{holdId}}
X-Student-Id: 20101234567890123

### Cancel as another student -> 404 Not Found
DELETE {{host}}/holds/{{holdId}}
X-Student-Id: 20109999999999999

### Cancel without X-Student-Id -> 400 Bad Request
DELETE {{host}}/holds/{{holdId}}

### List my holds -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/me/holds
X-Student-Id: 20101234567890123

### List my holds without X-Student-Id -> 400 Bad Request
GET {{host}}/me/holds
